00:01:39.933 --> 00:01:47.433 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Pour Daria, ce geste trahit

00:01:41.133 --> 00:01:48.667 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le désespoir de Poutine.

00:01:46.333 --> 00:01:50.200 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Mais elle admet que 300 000

00:01:47.533 --> 00:01:51.733 size:53% position:73% line:53%
