00:02:36.900 --> 00:02:40.467 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Le  séjour est organisé par

00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:41.667 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'International Republican

00:02:39.333 --> 00:02:42.867 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Institute, qui en est à

00:02:40.567 --> 00:02:44.100 size:53% position:73% line:53%
sa sixième mission de lobbying

00:02:41.767 --> 00:02:45.333 size:53% position:73% line:53%
en faveur de l'U....

00:02:42.967 --> 00:02:49.133 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Un Institut proche du parti

00:02:44.200 --> 00:02:50.333 size:53% position:73% line:53%
