00:03:05.167 --> 00:03:08.733 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Des décideurs à l'écoute,

00:03:06.367 --> 00:03:12.500 size:53% position:73% line:53%
mais qui  doivent eux-mêmes

00:03:07.633 --> 00:03:12.500 size:53% position:73% line:53%
tenir compte de l'opinion

00:03:08.833 --> 00:03:12.500 size:53% position:73% line:53%
